{:edb/db-before-t 1019 :edb/db-after-t 1020 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534332 50 #inst "2026-10-11T19:18:32.552Z" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186172130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186419401 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419395 1080 "uv\\sqrt{{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419395 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419395 1083 #uuid "1796399c-8c6d-5f22-bede-36efd1a03f5a" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419396 1080 "(uv+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419396 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419396 1083 #uuid "8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419397 1080 "(v+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{2}+4{u}^{4}}" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419397 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419397 1083 #uuid "bdf13d7f-d54d-59f5-9209-239de83443e0" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419398 1080 "(uv+{u}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{2}+4{u}^{4}}" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419398 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419398 1083 #uuid "bf1e4b2c-7a9b-5b87-a6e2-85dd90a414fd" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419399 1080 "{v}^{2}\\sqrt{{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419399 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419399 1083 #uuid "d04576fc-a1ab-5d09-bca6-54a80b70447c" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419395 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419396 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419397 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419398 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419399 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1077 "selection" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1078 #edb/ref 17592186419396 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419400 1079 #uuid "39e51a49-d535-578a-8167-c77ca61f8305" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1068 #edb/ref 17592186419400 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1069 "q-161133" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1071 "$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nConsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)=x+z$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨uv,\\,{u}^{2},\\,{v}^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ What is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}.$*" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1072 #uuid "4970a05a-3173-5c58-8ea3-194b8fc59474" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true] [17592186419401 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice that we are told that the norm of the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(x+z)\\,{|}_{x=uv\\,y={u}^{2}\\,z={v}^{2}} \\\\  & =uv+{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(uv+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534332 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-1796399c-8c6d-5f22-bede-36efd1a03f5a" 17592186419395 "answer-8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" 17592186419396 "answer-bdf13d7f-d54d-59f5-9209-239de83443e0" 17592186419397 "answer-bf1e4b2c-7a9b-5b87-a6e2-85dd90a414fd" 17592186419398 "answer-d04576fc-a1ab-5d09-bca6-54a80b70447c" 17592186419399 "answer-field-39e51a49-d535-578a-8167-c77ca61f8305" 17592186419400 "question-4970a05a-3173-5c58-8ea3-194b8fc59474" 17592186419401} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
